    "• Parametric Bands: Report Header, Page Header, Group Header(s), Report Detail, Group Footer(s), Page Footer, and Report Footer.\n• Elements: Static Labels, Bound Data Fields, Group & Report Aggregates (SUM, COUNT, AVG, MIN, MAX, STDDEV, VARIANCE), Barcodes (powered by zint), Images, and Lines.": {
